Source revision used: main at commit fc5a191 (2026-10-21),
Go pseudo-version v0.4.2-0.20261021222658-fc5a1910ad45.

- protocol/src/main/proto/*.proto are copied from vehicle-command without changes.
- The Kotlin code under protocol/src/main/kotlin (crypto, session, dispatch, transport, vehicle and
  commands) is a port of vehicle-command's Go code: internal/authentication, internal/dispatcher,
  pkg/protocol, pkg/vehicle, pkg/connector/ble and the command list of cmd/tesla-control. It was
  rewritten in Kotlin and adapted to Android; the wire format and cryptography are unchanged.
- protocol/src/test/resources/golden/commands.json was produced by running vehicle-command's own
  client (tools/vehicle-sim/sim/golden.go).
- tools/vehicle-sim builds a test-only vehicle simulator against vehicle-command's packages,
  including its internal authentication package. It is not part of the app.

